                                                "sense_id": "f2731ed7-6744-35be-a5db-af395195ce2b",
                                                "text": "But to myself I thought: ‘Considering that for eight whole years I sat on the front bench as top of the class while he drifted about somewhere in the middle, he can hardly fail to nourish a wish, left over from his schooldays, that some day or other I may come a complete cropper.’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "942c4b72-e555-4506-b86f-b9f641223a08",
                                                "sense_id": "f2731ed7-6744-35be-a5db-af395195ce2b",
                                                "text": "You're riding for a fall, Healey, you know that? There are hedges and ditches ahead and you are on course for an almighty cropper."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
